      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like the world has already decided i don't belong in it anymore. like i've been deleted. even if i stay, what am i actually doing? i'm just a burden or a nobody. there's no way to fix being a social pariah. once people decide you're nothing, you just are.",
